> +static u16 sunxi_nfc_randomizer_step(u16 state, int count)
> +{
> +       state &= 0x7fff;
> +       while (count--)
> +               state = ((state >> 1) |
> +                        ((((state >> 0) ^ (state >> 1)) & 1) << 14)) & 0x7fff;

As discussed on IRC, state >> 0 is state again.

